<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NEXORA Apps — Soluciones inteligentes para digitalizar tu negocio</title>
<meta name="description" content="Desarrollamos herramientas modernas para empresas, comercios y profesionales que buscan crecer con tecnología confiable y escalable.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='g' x1='0%25' y1='0%25' x2='100%25' y2='100%25'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%233d5a80'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%23ee6c4d'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' rx='20' fill='%230b0f1a'/%3E%3Cpath d='M20 50 L35 20 L65 20 L80 50 L65 80 L35 80 Z' fill='none' stroke='url(%23g)' stroke-width='6' stroke-linejoin='round'/%3E%3Cpath d='M38 50 L50 30 L55 48 L62 48 L50 70 L45 52 L38 52 Z' fill='url(%23g)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root{--primary:#3d5a80;--primary-light:#98c1d9;--accent:#ee6c4d;--dark:#293241;--light:#e0fbfc;--bg:#0b0f1a;--bg-card:#161a2a;--bg-card-hover:#1e2440;--text:#c8ccd8;--text-light:#7a8090;--border:rgba(152,193,217,0.08);--glass:rgba(22,26,42,0.75);--gradient-1:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d5a80,#98c1d9);--gradient-2:linear-gradient(135deg,#ee6c4d,#f5a082);--gradient-hero:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% -20%,rgba(61,90,128,0.15),transparent),radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 80% 60%,rgba(238,108,77,0.08),transparent),linear-gradient(180deg,#0b0f1a,#0f1424);--font-display:'Plus Jakarta Sans','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;--font-body:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--font-body);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
::selection{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.container{width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.section{padding:100px 0}
.section-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem);font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;background:var(--gradient-1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.section-subtitle{text-align:center;color:var(--text-light);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 56px;line-height:1.7}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);font-family:var(--font-body);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.btn-primary{background:var(--gradient-1);color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(61,90,128,.35)}
.btn-accent{background:var(--gradient-2);color:#fff}
.btn-accent:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(238,108,77,.35)}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--bg-card);border-color:var(--primary-light)}
.btn-outline-light{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.btn-outline-light:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
/* ─── NAVBAR ─── */
.navbar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:1000;padding:16px 0;transition:all .4s;background:transparent}
.navbar.scrolled{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px 0}
.navbar .container{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.navbar-brand{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;background:var(--gradient-1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.navbar-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;list-style:none}
.navbar-links a{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-light);transition:color .3s;position:relative}
.navbar-links a:hover,.navbar-links a.active{color:var(--text)}
.navbar-links a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-4px;left:0;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--gradient-1);transition:width .3s;border-radius:1px}
.navbar-links a:hover::after{width:100%}
.navbar-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;color:var(--text);font-size:1.5rem;cursor:pointer;padding:4px}
/* ─── HERO ─── */
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:var(--gradient-hero);padding-top:80px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:2}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:100px;border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--primary-light);margin-bottom:24px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.hero-badge span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse-dot{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.4}}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.2rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:20px;letter-spacing:-1.5px}
.hero h1 .gradient-text{background:var(--gradient-2);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.hero p{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;max-width:520px;margin-bottom:36px}
.hero-buttons{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-visual{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}
.hero-visual-inner{width:100%;max-width:520px;aspect-ratio:4/3;position:relative;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(61,90,128,.1),rgba(238,108,77,.05));border:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden;backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.hero-grid-lines{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(152,193,217,.04) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(152,193,217,.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px}
.hero-glow{position:absolute;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(80px);opacity:.3;pointer-events:none}
.hero-glow-1{background:var(--primary);top:-60px;right:-60px;animation:float-glow 8s ease-in-out infinite}
.hero-glow-2{background:var(--accent);bottom:-60px;left:-60px;animation:float-glow 10s ease-in-out infinite reverse}
@keyframes float-glow{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)}50%{transform:translate(20px,-20px)}}
.hero-cards-mockup{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
.hero-card-item{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;width:100%;max-width:380px;animation:float-card 6s ease-in-out infinite}
.hero-card-item:nth-child(2){animation-delay:-3s;opacity:.7;max-width:340px;margin-top:8px;transform:scale(.95)}
@keyframes float-card{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}
.hero-card-icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff}
.hero-card-content{flex:1}
.hero-card-content strong{display:block;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text)}
.hero-card-content small{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--text-light)}
.hero-scroll{position:absolute;bottom:32px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--text-light);font-size:.75rem;animation:bounce-scroll 2s ease-in-out infinite;z-index:2}
.hero-scroll i{font-size:1.2rem}
@keyframes bounce-scroll{0%,100%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px)}}
/* ─── PRODUCT CARDS ─── */
.products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px}
.product-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:32px 28px;transition:all .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:default}
.product-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:20px;padding:1px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,transparent 30%,rgba(152,193,217,.1) 70%,transparent 90%);-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s}
.product-card:hover::before{opacity:1}
.product-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.product-card-coming{opacity:.6}
.product-card-coming:hover{opacity:.8}
.card-glow{position:absolute;width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(60px);opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s;pointer-events:none;top:-30px;right:-30px}
.product-card:hover .card-glow{opacity:.3}
.card-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.3rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:20px;position:relative}
.product-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--text)}
.product-card p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px}
.card-badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}
.card-badge-coming{background:rgba(238,108,77,.12);color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(238,108,77,.2)}
.card-links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:auto}
.card-links a{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary-light);transition:color .3s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.card-links a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
/* ─── BENTO GRID ─── */
.bento-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.bento-item{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;transition:all .3s}
.bento-item:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.bento-item.colspan-2{grid-column:span 2}
.bento-item .icon{font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:14px;display:block}
.bento-item h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text)}
.bento-item p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6}
/* ─── STATS ─── */
.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;text-align:center}
.stat-item{padding:32px 16px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;transition:all .3s}
.stat-item:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.stat-number{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--gradient-1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin-bottom:4px}
.stat-label{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light)}
/* ─── DEMOS ─── */
.demos-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:20px}
.demo-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:28px;transition:all .4s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.demo-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.demo-card .mockup{height:180px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(61,90,128,.15),rgba(238,108,77,.08));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2rem;color:var(--text-light);border:1px solid var(--border);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.demo-card .mockup-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(152,193,217,.04) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(152,193,217,.04) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:24px 24px}
.demo-card h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.demo-card p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px}
.demo-links{display:flex;gap:12px}
.demo-links a{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:10px;transition:all .3s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
/* ─── DIFFERENTIAL ─── */
.diff-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:16px}
.diff-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;padding:20px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;transition:all .3s}
.diff-item:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover)}
.diff-icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
.diff-text h4{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.diff-text p{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.5}
/* ─── CONTACT ─── */
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start}
.contact-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
.contact-card{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;transition:all .3s}
.contact-card:hover{background:var(--bg-card-hover)}
.contact-card .icon{font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:12px;display:block}
.contact-card h4{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.contact-card p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light)}
.contact-form{background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:32px}
.form-group{margin-bottom:16px}
.form-group label{display:block;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--text)}
.form-group input,.form-group textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:.88rem;transition:all .3s;outline:none}
.form-group input:focus,.form-group textarea:focus{border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(61,90,128,.15)}
.form-group textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:100px}
.form-check{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.form-check input[type=checkbox]{margin-top:3px;accent-color:var(--primary);width:16px;height:16px}
.form-check label{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.5}
.form-check a{color:var(--primary-light);text-decoration:underline}
.form-error{color:var(--accent);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:4px;display:none}
/* ─── FOOTER ─── */
.footer{background:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:60px 0 0}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr;gap:40px;padding-bottom:40px}
.footer-brand{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--gradient-1);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin-bottom:12px;display:block}
.footer-desc{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px}
.footer-social{display:flex;gap:12px}
.footer-social a{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--text-light);transition:all .3s;font-size:.9rem}
.footer-social a:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--primary);background:rgba(61,90,128,.1)}
.footer h5{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:16px}
.footer ul{list-style:none}
.footer ul li{margin-bottom:10px}
.footer ul a{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light);transition:color .3s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.footer ul a:hover{color:var(--text)}
.footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:20px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-light)}
/* ─── COOKIE BANNER ─── */
.cookie-banner{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;background:var(--bg-card);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px 24px;display:none;transform:translateY(100%);transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.cookie-banner.show{display:block;transform:translateY(0)}
.cookie-banner .container{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cookie-text{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--text-light);flex:1;min-width:240px}
.cookie-text a{color:var(--primary-light);text-decoration:underline}
.cookie-buttons{display:flex;gap:10px}
/* ─── SCROLL REVEAL ─── */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:all .7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
/* ─── MOBILE ─── */
@media(max-width:768px){
.section{padding:60px 0}
.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;text-align:center}
.hero p{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.hero-buttons{justify-content:center}
.hero-visual{display:none}
.products-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.bento-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
.bento-item.colspan-2{grid-column:span 1}
.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
.stat-number{font-size:1.8rem}
.demos-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px}
.footer-grid>*:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}
.navbar-links{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;right:0;background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);flex-direction:column;padding:20px 24px;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.navbar-links.open{display:flex}
.navbar-toggle{display:block}
.cookie-banner .container{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}
.footer-bottom{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.hero h1{font-size:2rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
  <div class="container">
    <a href="#hero" class="navbar-brand">NEXORA</a>
    <ul class="navbar-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#productos" class="active">Productos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#tecnologia">Tecnolog&iacute;a</a></li>
      <li><a href="#beneficios">Beneficios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
      <li><a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-light" style="padding:8px 20px;font-size:.82rem" onclick="event.preventDefault();document.getElementById('contacto').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Solicitar Informaci&oacute;n</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="navbar-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Menú"><i class="bi bi-list"></i></button>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge"><span></span> Ecosistema de soluciones inteligentes</div>
        <h1>Potenci&aacute; tu negocio con<br><span class="gradient-text">NEXORA Apps</span></h1>
        <p>Soluciones inteligentes para digitalizar, automatizar y potenciar negocios. Desarrollamos herramientas modernas para empresas, comercios y profesionales que buscan crecer con tecnolog&iacute;a confiable y escalable.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#productos" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="bi bi-grid"></i> Explorar Productos</a>
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-outline"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i> Solicitar Informaci&oacute;n</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-visual-inner">
          <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
          <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-1"></div>
          <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-2"></div>
          <div class="hero-cards-mockup" style="flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
            <div class="hero-card-item">
              <div class="hero-card-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3d5a80,#98c1d9)"><i class="bi bi-cpu"></i></div>
              <div class="hero-card-content">
                <strong>Nexora Core</strong>
                <small>Gesti&oacute;n empresarial integral</small>
              </div>
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" style="color:#3d5a80;font-size:1.1rem"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-card-item" style="animation-delay:-2s">
              <div class="hero-card-icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ee6c4d,#f5a082)"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i></div>
              <div class="hero-card-content">
                <strong>Nexora Booking</strong>
                <small>Reservas y turnos inteligentes</small>
              </div>
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" style="color:#ee6c4d;font-size:1.1rem"></i>
            </div>
